  "text_md": "![](<8b02fcbf9bc4d7bb680e85c1a3c40f7ef60f_pg3_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\nSIM UNIVERSITY\n\nSECTION 4: Questionaire (please tick the relevant boxes and indicate the sources through which you came to know about this programme)  \n\nAdvertisement\n\nFairs / Seminars\n\nMailers\n\nOnline\n\nPublications\n\nWord-of-mouth\n\nOthers\n\nSECTION 5: Selection of Courses (please tick the course(s) that you are interested in and indicate whether you would like to enroll on the course(s) on an audit (A) or credit basis (C), by indicating A or C respectively.)    \n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Course Code</th>\n    <th>Course Name</th>\n    <th>Audit/Credit  </th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>CCLSD5OI</td>\n    <td>and Practice in Community Leadership and Social Development Theory</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>CCLSD5O3</td>\n    <td>Economic and Political Development for Social Well-being</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>CCLSD5OS</td>\n    <td>Gender, Ethnicity and Diversity</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>CCLSD5O7</td>\n    <td>Community Leadership and Organisational Development</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>CCLSDSO9</td>\n    <td>Methods of Social Research and Knowledge Application</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td> </td>\n    <td>Project Design, Management and Evaluation</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>CCLSDS13</td>\n    <td>and Welfare in Relation to Social Capital</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>CCLSD515</td>\n    <td>and Community Negotiations</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>CCLSDS17</td>\n    <td>and Corporate Social Responsibility</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>CCLSDS19</td>\n    <td>Population and Environmental Management</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>CCLSD521</td>\n    <td>Leadership and Capacity Building</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>CCLSD523</td>\n    <td>Leadership and Social Development</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\nCourse Schedule is listed at www.unisim.edu.sg, under Programmes >Graduate Studies> Community Leadership and Social Development > Master in Community Leadership and Social Development >Curriculum & Scheduling   Note:\n\nNote:\n\nAudit – Class Attendance only. Assessment is not required of participant.\n\n",
